`148cbf85ce4c7682`, round-gate `f890e277af83a78f`, proxy-check
`a052ddb97a0b6f84`, claims-check `e9a21b441f1216bf`, kimi-census
`83016d45049b009a`. Command: per gate, `node scripts/<gate>.mjs --selftest`
