  `env -i PATH HOME=$h/home TMPDIR=$h/tmp LC_ALL=C GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1
  GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES=$h node "$MUTANT" --selftest`, with a per-defect
